{"id":"n28311-1-8","stage":3,"title":"넘어뜨리다 · 推倒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28311-1-8-1","ko":"네가 발을 걸어서 나를 넘어뜨렸잖아!","zh":"明明是你伸脚把我绊倒的！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"발을","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발을","audio":"/audio/bce84895e74d38be0e63.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어서","meaning":"勾，绊","explanation":"걸다：勾，绊；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"16","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어서","audio":"/audio/ccc311521d028aa1de80.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어뜨렸잖아!","meaning":"推倒","explanation":"넘어뜨리다：推倒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"넘어뜨리다","audio":"/audio/5f29b592d8edb10f433f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28311","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어뜨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어뜨렸잖아","audio":"/audio/298f314e9582c3e2df05.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"勾，绊","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"想使用腿、脚等，绊倒对方。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"5f29b592d8edb10f","term":"넘어뜨리다","zh":"推倒","audio":"/audio/5f29b592d8edb10f433f.mp3","entryId":"28311","definition":"把站得很直的人或事物弄倒。","pronunciation":["너머뜨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f96eb204f78f1d791977.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28311-1-8-2","ko":"내가 일부러 그런 게 아니라 너 혼자 걸려 넘어진 거라니까!","zh":"我又不是故意的，是你自己绊倒的！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"일부러","meaning":"故意地","explanation":"일부러：故意地。","readings":[{"term":"일부러","audio":"/audio/f480026f697b4b9df412.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25159","senseId":"2","lemma":"일부러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일부러","audio":"/audio/f480026f697b4b9df412.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样。","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"아니라","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"아니라","audio":"/audio/1a1abd38241aca48f9a0.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니라","audio":"/audio/1a1abd38241aca48f9a0.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려","meaning":"被勾，被绊","explanation":"걸리다：被勾，被绊；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"17","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려","audio":"/audio/794467180c643d4431c1.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어진","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어진","audio":"/audio/c09ac762b422c1836ac8.mp3"}},{"text":"거라니까!","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거라니까","audio":"/audio/b099af0c4d22c6ac5734.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2